        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we can focus our resources on product design, quality assurance, marketing, and customer support.",
        "start_character": 26556,
        "end_character": 26666
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the event that we are able to sell licensed products into the China market, we may not be able to pass along all or any of the tariff to our customers, and may be subject to litigation, increased costs, and a harmed competitive position.",
        "start_character": 35824,
        "end_character": 36064
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To execute our business strategy successfully, we focus on recruiting, developing, and retaining top global talent.",
        "start_character": 42158,
        "end_character": 42273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have partnerships in automotive, healthcare, financial services, manufacturing, retail, and technology among others, to accelerate the adoption of AI.",
        "start_character": 11279,
        "end_character": 11437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the depth and quality of our design support are key to improving our partner network’s time-to-market, maintaining a high level of customer satisfaction, and fostering relationships that encourage our customers and partner network to use the next generation of our products within each platform.",
        "start_character": 24371,
        "end_character": 24682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the principal competitive factors in this market are performance, breadth of product offerings, access to customers and partners and distribution channels, software support, conformity to industry standard APIs, manufacturing capabilities, processor pricing, and total system costs.",
        "start_character": 27880,
        "end_character": 28178
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We engage with independent subcontractors and contract manufacturers such as Hon Hai Precision Industry Co., Ltd., Wistron Corporation, and Fabrinet to perform assembly, testing and packaging of our final products.",
        "start_character": 27516,
        "end_character": 27730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect competition to increase from both existing competitors and new market entrants with products that may be lower priced than ours or may provide better performance or additional features not provided by our products.",
        "start_character": 28495,
        "end_character": 28719
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We serve the Professional Visualization market by working closely with independent software vendors, or ISVs, to optimize their offerings for NVIDIA GPUs.",
        "start_character": 15009,
        "end_character": 15163
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we work to enhance the resiliency and redundancy of our supply chain, which is currently concentrated in Asia, new and existing export controls or changes to existing export controls could limit alternative manufacturing locations and negatively impact our business.",
        "start_character": 40410,
        "end_character": 40682
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we can avoid many of the significant costs and risks associated with owning and operating manufacturing operations.",
        "start_character": 26169,
        "end_character": 26298
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001045810-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001045810-26-000021-73d81f5a111abcf7",
        "accession_number": "0001045810-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of the end of fiscal year 2026, we were effectively foreclosed from competing in China's data center computing/compute market, and our effective foreclosure from the China market helped our competitors build larger developer and customer ecosystems to challenge us worldwide.",
        "start_character": 36529,
        "end_character": 36807
      }
